 "head": {
  "text": "WF-031 Resynchronization, late edge with a phase error larger than SJW"
 },
 "foot": {
  "text": "The third bit starts 4 quanta late (e = +4 > SJW = 2): PHASE_SEG1 is lengthened by SJW = 2, so the sample point of that bit moves 2 quanta later and the cell is 12 quanta long (REF-002 resynchronization). The following edge has e = +2 and acts as a hard synchronization."
 }
